# Expo/React Native native builds require a real (non-symlinked) node_modules
# layout: CMake/ninja depfile paths break on pnpm's symlink store during
# codegen C++ compilation (react-native-screens / safe-area-context).
# https://docs.expo.dev/guides/monorepos/#can-i-use-another-monorepo-tool
node-linker=hoisted
